    "detailed_description": "A chance meeting can't lead to a long-lasting friendship. Or can it?<br><br>While there is little in common between these four young people, but the life throws all the kind of adventures they have to brave together:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Find out how a pieceful town suddenly became full of zombies<br></li><li> Discover an ancient vampire, who is definitely looking for human sacrifices<br></li><li> Get into the university, even though you probably couldn't pass an exam in your life</li></ul><br>The game includes all 3 episodes of classical 2011 point-and-click adventure game, and features light-hearted script, bright anumesque art, full voiceover and several mini-games.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526940/extras/9132972d4e50c2e6965bc47cc7edbff6.webp?t=1702912588\" /></span><br>A little blonde angel, who will be sweet and smiling until you accidentally spoil her hairdo \u2013 or stain her new blouse at the cost of a new car.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526940/extras/151e2711bfacf378ea29bb6c601b49c1.webp?t=1702912588\" /></span><br>She loves her old Harley Davidson and\u2026 and, well, nothing except that. She can solve most of her problems on her own and hates asking anyone for help. She also hates the ones who cause those problems.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526940/extras/d4de9472912b9a43f0f4dd104f8511f9.webp?t=1702912588\" /></span><br>Calm to phlegmatism, he is difficult to surprise or upset. He treats girls with a slight allowance, but as a true gentleman he is always eager to help them. This feature, however, often collides with his laziness.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526940/extras/02c5ca6c90d154d7d39117121a1efe06.webp?t=1702912588\" /></span><br>He is always good-looking and good-mannered. Being everybody\u2019s favourite, he uses this circumstance shamelessly. Not everyone is sure if he can feel shame at all, though. On the other hand, he\u2019s got money and insolence.",
